/section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>二、接收报名专业</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/IBqe5ibp6ia5EBBzU4jjXho2JTxxZHEfOlDg2Fa9XNxfXUUxPczicUWGAgrvbRgjKYX8uJnq066fF3pwj7e0QXAt4x2oZztELQfA4aHXw6kq10/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>三、报名时间</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>7月27日8:00-9月16日18:00。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>四、报名方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1、申请者登录“大连理工大学接收推荐免试攻读研究生预报名系统”https://yjszs.dlut.edu.cn/zsbm/logon进行报名，报名前请仔细阅读申请须知，并按照其要求完成申报；</span></p><p><strong><span>注意：招生项目请选择“推免生预报名”</span></strong></p><p><span>2、申请者须在报名系统中提交如下材料：</span></p><p><span><span>（1）本科学习期间的成绩单，需有本科所在学院或学校相关部门盖章；</span></span></p><p><span>（2）本科学习期间排名证明材料，需有本科所在学院或学校相关部门盖章；</span></p><p><span>（3）其他材料：如四六级成绩单、科技创新类奖项获奖证明以及其他能证明学生科研素养、科研潜力的材料。</span></p><p><strong><span>注：申请者请将材料放在一个PDF文件中上传,所有证明材料均要扫描原件。命名方式为“报名号+考生姓名”。</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>五、报名审核</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>我院根据考生报名情况进行集中审核，在系统中通知考生审核结果，请注意查看。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>六、考核安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>学院计划在9月中下旬组织面试，具体面试时间及要求详见后续通知。</span></p><p><span>通过“我校接收推免生预报名系统”材料审核和我院考核的申请者，须按照规定时间在“全国推免服务系统”中申报我院，未在规定时间申报者前期考核结果无效。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>七、联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：王老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0411-84706054</span></p><p><span>联系邮箱：wangguoji1126@dlut.edu.cn</span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>若本通知与学校或上级单位发布的新规定不符，按照学校或上级单位发布的新规定执行。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>公共管理学院</span></p><p><span>2026年7月25日</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><p><strong><span>初审 | 王国际</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>复审 | 刘毅</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>终审 | 丁云哲</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>排版 | 关佳媛</span></strong></p></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"1f96a926475b5917cc8cfa0e9500233b19ac43b6081024f760e6b4feca6b86cb","textLength":872,"sourceSha256":"b49451d1ff8525c6a82e59e58328fb8c8cc187342d5f68e5f6dd99538db50bb1","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0dfedb13512d80a702b8","title":"2026年大连理工大学公共管理学院接收2027年推荐免试研究生预报名系统开放通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:53:16.635517+00:00"}
